@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@roomId = YOUR_ROOM_ID

### Search products with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?q=countertop&style=modern&category=surfaces&maxPrice=5000

### Search products by room type
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?roomType=kitchen

### Search products by style only
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?style=minimalist

### Get product recommendations for a room
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/products
